00:31:11.900 --> 00:31:19.030
and what was happening in public opinion the disconnect was amazing Marcia Angel

00:31:19.030 --> 00:31:23.110
the executive editor of the New England Journal of Medicine had been troubled by

00:31:23.110 --> 00:31:25.990
