00:37:34.010 --> 00:37:37.630
Others seemed to have disintegrated.

00:37:37.630 --> 00:37:40.310
No one was quite sure of the reason.

00:37:40.310 --> 00:37:43.910
Trauma, age, weaknesses, surgical nicks.

00:37:43.910 --> 00:37:48.950
