00:50:23.120 --> 00:50:30.000
roughly 90,000 nurses. Again a very old database looking at

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:36.630
things that had happened in the past before all the publicity and this too

00:50:36.630 --> 00:50:42.500
could find no connection between breast implants and connective tissue diseases

00:50:42.500 --> 00:50:48.060
or symptoms certain symptoms of connective tissue diseases so these were

00:50:48.060 --> 00:50:52.880
the two studies that the New England Journal of Medicine published both very

00:50:52.880 --> 00:50:57.790
well-designed epidemiologic studies neither one of which could find a

00:50:57.790 --> 00:51:00.000
connection only one

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:04.440
