00:51:41.760 --> 00:51:46.600
have good scientists from good institutions go out and do good studies

00:51:46.600 --> 00:51:53.450
and put them into good journals. I think it's critical for people to recognize

00:51:53.450 --> 00:52:00.000
that without exception these well-done studies have shown no. I

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:11.660
I repeat, no association between silicone breast implants and autoimmune diseases or any type of autoimmune response.

00:52:12.610 --> 00:52:17.180
